flowchart TD

    Customer[Customer]

    Customer --> CDN

    CDN[AWS CloudFront]

    CDN --> LoadBalancer

    LoadBalancer[AWS Load Balancer]

    LoadBalancer --> PrimaryRegion

    subgraph PrimaryRegion["AWS Primary Region"]

        App1[Application Server 1]
        App2[Application Server 2]

        App1 --> PrimaryDB
        App2 --> PrimaryDB

        App1 --> PrimaryRedis
        App2 --> PrimaryRedis

        PrimaryDB[(MySQL Primary)]
        PrimaryRedis[(Redis Primary)]
    end

    PrimaryDB --> ReplicaDB

    ReplicaDB[(Read Replica)]

    PrimaryDB --> BackupProcess

    BackupProcess[Automated Backup Service]

    BackupProcess --> S3Backup

    S3Backup[(AWS S3 Backups)]

    S3Backup --> SecondaryRegion

    subgraph SecondaryRegion["AWS Disaster Recovery Region"]

        DRApp1[DR Application Server]

        DRDB[(MySQL Disaster Recovery)]

        DRRedis[(Redis Disaster Recovery)]

        DRApp1 --> DRDB
        DRApp1 --> DRRedis
    end

    PrimaryRegion --> Monitoring

    SecondaryRegion --> Monitoring

    Monitoring[Monitoring Platform]

    Monitoring --> Alerting

    Alerting[Alerting System]

    Alerting --> OperationsTeam

    OperationsTeam[Operations Team]

    PrimaryDB --> Failure

    Failure[Primary Region Failure]

    Failure --> Detection

    Detection[Failure Detection]

    Detection --> DRActivation

    DRActivation[Disaster Recovery Activation]

    DRActivation --> DNSFailover

    DNSFailover[DNS Failover]

    DNSFailover --> SecondaryRegion

    SecondaryRegion --> ServiceRecovery

    ServiceRecovery[Service Restored]

    ServiceRecovery --> Customer

    PrimaryRedis --> RedisReplication

    RedisReplication[Redis Replication]

    RedisReplication --> DRRedis

    PrimaryDB --> DatabaseReplication

    DatabaseReplication[Cross Region Replication]

    DatabaseReplication --> DRDB

    Monitoring --> RTO

    Monitoring --> RPO

    RTO[Recovery Time Objective]

    RPO[Recovery Point Objective]

    BackupValidation[Backup Validation Testing]

    BackupValidation --> S3Backup

    BackupValidation --> DRDB

    SecurityIncident[Security Incident]

    SecurityIncident --> Isolation

    Isolation[Affected Systems Isolation]

    Isolation --> RecoveryProcess

    RecoveryProcess[Recovery Procedures]

    RecoveryProcess --> ServiceRecovery

    OperationsTeam --> DRDrill

    DRDrill[Disaster Recovery Drills]

    DRDrill --> Preparedness

    Preparedness[Recovery Readiness]